Seven plugin sites also check the flag: `dynannotate.js:68`, `geomap.js:53`, `highlightblock.js:33,39`, `twitter-widget.js:112`, `innerwiki.js:61,95,108,130`, `codemirror/engine.js:112` and `katex/wrapper.js:58`.

