!! B. Page never a vessel: the anon-device browser vessel

!!! B0. Today's unlock path, mapped

''Threads''
* ''Page main thread:'' `main.ts`, `openBrowserVessel`, `standBrowserCustody`, `browser-custody.ts`, `browser-vessel-identity.ts`, `browser-face-atom.ts`, `browser-keyhive-archive.ts`, `browser-face-anchor.ts`, `browser-face-presentation.ts`, `browser-fleet-join.ts`, `browser-walk.ts` and `browser-handle-verbs.ts`.
