** The wiki islands: `main.ts:43,47` → `browser-wiki-worker.ts`, spawned at `browser-vessel-island-pool.ts:72`.
* ''SharedWorker holder:'' `shared-holder.ts:85`, opt-in by the `?holder` URL query (`main.ts:53-62`).
* ''No worker-side module imports `browser-custody.ts`.''

''The opened tree key''
