* It lives in a page-module `Map` (`browser-custody.ts:96`).
* Minted at `:546` and stored at `:551`, or opened through `openTreeKey` (`:565`; scrypt N=2^17 in `lararium-mesh/src/keyslot.ts:55,165`, HKDF at `:159`, XChaCha unwrap at `:276`) and stored at `:580`.
* Dropped at `lockBrowserCustody` (`:99-102`) and at clear (`:684`).
